# C8 anion addition: free catalyst, displaced along its imaginary mode.
#
# free_cat_b973c/ optimised to ORCA's gradient criteria but has ONE imaginary
# mode at -64.5 cm-1 (with a +64.6 twin): a soft coordinate 97% localised on the
# QM region, dominated by the C124H2 methylene (H125/H126/C124). So the previous
# point is a shallow saddle, not a minimum, and its G is not usable.
#
# Standard fix: displace 0.15 A (max atomic) along that mode and re-optimise.
# This is the +/- pair; whichever lands as a true minimum (no imaginary modes)
# is the free-cat reference. Same level as the complex: QM/XTB B97-3c, 14-atom
# QM1 {55 58 61 64 120...129}, Charge_total 0.
! QM/XTB B97-3c ddCOSMO(Water) Opt Freq TightOpt TightSCF

%QMMM
QMATOMS
	{55 58 61 64 120 121 122 123 124 125 126 127 128 129}
END
Charge_total 0
Mult_total 1
AutoFF_QM2_Method GFNFF
END

%geom
  MaxIter 500
end

%output jsonpropfile true end

%maxcore 4000

%pal
   nprocs 8
end

* xyzfile 0 1 job.xyz
